<title>EGYPT: Egyptian all-share index at record high.</title>
<headline>Egyptian all-share index at record high.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-01-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Egyptian all-share index closed at a record high of 322.44 points on Sunday, 2.6 percent up on 314.20 points at Thursday's close.</p>
<p>Data from the stock exchange showed that the six most active shares all rose, some by as much as 10 percent.</p>
<p>Thursday's close was also a record high, the sixth in as many trading days.</p>
<p>-- Jonathan Wright +20 2 578 3290/1</p>
</text>
